# Lutri, the Spellchaser copies Bot1's Archenemy's Charm, cast with "Return one or two target creature and/or planeswalker
# cards from your graveyard to your hand" at Ornithopter and Chandra, Torch of Defiance. The copy has the same mode
# (CR 707.10c) and Bot1 may choose new targets for it, as many as the original chose, one occurrence at a time
# (CR 115.7d, 601.2c). Faithless Looting and choosing a target twice are refused (CR 115.3);
# Bot1 takes Chandra and Llanowar Elves. The copy resolves first and returns Chandra and Llanowar Elves; the original then returns
# Ornithopter (its Chandra target has left the graveyard, CR 608.2b). Left on its old targets, the copy would leave Llanowar Elves in
# the graveyard. Llanowar Elves gets there by a Lightning Bolt; Ornithopter and Chandra by Faithless Looting.

